# ArchiMate derivation axioms — relationship strength, categories, and the Appendix B permitted matrix
# GENERATED by tools/relationships2axioms.py — do not hand-edit.
# Source: the CASED Appendix B tables (UPPERCASE=direct, lowercase=derived).
@prefix archi: <https://purl.org/archimate#> .
@prefix owl:   <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# Generated from derivation/relationships.xml. Do not edit by hand.
#
# archi:permits<Relation>       permitted, whether directly or by derivation
# archi:permitsDirect<Relation> permitted DIRECTLY — assertable per the metamodel
#
# Every permitsDirect triple is also a permits triple. A relationship that is permitted
# but not permitted-direct is one Appendix B sanctions only as a derivation.

